{"4599970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep Space Survivor: Endless Starfield", "steam_appid": 4599970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4782110], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, Survivors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Deep Space Survivor: Endless Starfield* is a survival-style game. Your starship has accidentally entered an unknown universe. Fight your way through endless hordes of enemies, explore multiple star systems, and collect meteorite resources to build your ultimate orbital weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Space Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate enemies, collect ore, upgrade a variety of incredible weapons and gear, and survive in this alien universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/875f7cea332b8e24fb78b6e1da11b26b.poster.avif?t=1788264538\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/875f7cea332b8e24fb78b6e1da11b26b.webm?t=1788264538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/875f7cea332b8e24fb78b6e1da11b26b.mp4?t=1788264538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Multiple Star Systems:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out for different star systems, face diverse enemies, and navigate unique environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/2ed351b2580eaef5fce265e352823d6a.poster.avif?t=1788264538\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/2ed351b2580eaef5fce265e352823d6a.webm?t=1788264538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/2ed351b2580eaef5fce265e352823d6a.mp4?t=1788264538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Super Weapons:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different progression paths, craft your own super weapons, and return victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/9c6382ef4ec34931cd1d7a52335ad118.poster.avif?t=1788264538\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/9c6382ef4ec34931cd1d7a52335ad118.webm?t=1788264538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/9c6382ef4ec34931cd1d7a52335ad118.mp4?t=1788264538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, Survivors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Deep Space Survivor: Endless Starfield* is a survival-style game. Your starship has accidentally entered an unknown universe. Fight your way through endless hordes of enemies, explore multiple star systems, and collect meteorite resources to build your ultimate orbital weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Space Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate enemies, collect ore, upgrade a variety of incredible weapons and gear, and survive in this alien universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4599970/extras/875f7cea332b8e24fb78b6e1da11b26b.poster.avif?t=1788264538\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i